# Note: benchmark/*.py scripts are kept as they enable important evaluation workflows.
# Generated outputs (.csv, .txt, benchmark_results/) should be ignored.

# Experimental scripts archive
# Keep these archived files in archive/ for reference:
# - debug_*.py (debug scripts)
# - generate_mixed_pretraining_shards.py (experimental mixed data prep)
# - train_mixed_tokenizer.py (experimental tokenizer training)
# - recover_mixture_manifest.py (mixed shard manifest recovery)
# - test_expert_forward_count.py (MoE debugging)
# - test_inference_scaling.py (KV cache scaling tests)
# - test_kv_cache.py (KV cache tests)
# - test_quick_training.py (quick training utility)
# - benchmark_inference.py (inference benchmarking)
# - build_document_indexes.py (index building utility)
# - prepare_smoltalk.py (smol-smoltalk data prep)
# - tokenizer_check.py (tokenizer testing utility)
# - validate_fused_local_softmax.py (validation utility)
#
# NOTE: Evaluation scripts are now in root `benchmarks/` directory:
# - evaluate_corpus.py
# - evaluate_lambada.py
# - evaluate_wikitext.py
